            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Bếp Quê",
            "review_text": "희동\n5 contributions\n0\nBest restaurant near Da Nang Han Market!\nJan 2024 • Friends\nIt's near Han Market and Pink Cathedral, so it's very accessible. The store is on the second floor, which is nice. It has air conditioning 👍👍\nThe mango salad looked amazing and I ordered the combo b and the lamb was great!! I recommend it\nShow original\nWritten January 28, 2024",
